===Legislative Assembly===
In addition to its president and vice presidents, Panama elected a new [[Legislative Assembly of Panama|Legislative Assembly]] (78 members), 20 deputies to represent the country at the [[Central American Parliament]], and a string of mayors and other municipal officers.

